          "level": "subdivision",
          "bluebell_keyword": "SUBPARAGRAPH",
          "numbering": "roman_lower_parenthesized"
        }
      ],
      "hcontainers": [],
      "note": "Laws enacted by State Legislative Assemblies (Dewan Undangan Negeri) of 13 states. Called Enactments (Enakmen) in Peninsular Malaysia and Sabah; Ordinances (Ordinan) in Sarawak. Structurally identical to Federal Acts. FRBR URI uses ISO 3166-2 state sub-national code."
    },
