      "hcontainers": [],
      "note": "Islamic law legislation enacted by State Legislative Assemblies under the State List (Federal Constitution, Ninth Schedule). Applies to Muslims only. FRBR URI uses my-{state-code}/act/syariah/{year}/{number}. Federal Territory Islamic legislation is Federal Acts, not State Enactments."
